PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE INTERNAL_EXECUTION
# Serial IDT occurrence origin; node = [parent,incoming_edge,winding,spinor_i_sign,theta,object].
# theta=0 is a relative reference; not the RDSS singularity coordinate.
OP OBJECT SOURCE now.object
OP HOTEL IDENTITY NONE
OP WINDING IDENTITY 0
OP SIGN IDENTITY 1
OP THETA IDENTITY 0
OP NOW COMPOSITION HOTEL NONE WINDING SIGN THETA OBJECT
OP INDEX IDENTITY WINDING
EMIT HOTEL
EMIT NOW
EMIT INDEX
EMIT WINDING
EMIT SIGN
EMIT THETA
